    "Reason : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 21 January 2026, the proposed use of 6 Harewood Road, within Use Class C3(b) was not lawful within the meaning of Section 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended) because:\r\nInsufficient information has been submitted to demonstrate that the proposal would fall within Use Class C3(b) and would not result in a material change of use of the site under Section 55 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended). Planning permission is therefore required."
